{"suttaId":"thag7.4","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2076,2098],"vripara":"480"},"segments":{"thag7.4:0.4":"Sopākattheragāthā","thag7.4:1.1":"“Disvā pāsādachāyāyaṃ, caṅkamantaṃ naruttamaṃ;","thag7.4:1.3":"Tattha naṃ upasaṅkamma, vandissaṃ [vandisaṃ (sī. pī.)] purisuttamaṃ.","thag7.4:2.1":"“Ekaṃsaṃ cīvaraṃ katvā, saṃharitvāna pāṇayo;","thag7.4:2.3":"Anucaṅkamissaṃ virajaṃ, sabbasattānamuttamaṃ.","thag7.4:3.1":"“Tato pañhe apucchi maṃ, pañhānaṃ kovido vidū;","thag7.4:3.3":"Acchambhī ca abhīto ca, byākāsiṃ satthuno ahaṃ.","thag7.4:4.1":"“Vissajjitesu pañhesu, anumodi tathāgato;","thag7.4:4.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghaṃ viloketvā, imamatthaṃ abhāsatha”.","thag7.4:5.1":"“Lābhā aṅgānaṃ magadhānaṃ, yesāyaṃ paribhuñjati;","thag7.4:5.3":"Cīvaraṃ piṇḍapātañca, paccayaṃ sayanāsanaṃ;","thag7.4:5.5":"Paccuṭṭhānañca sāmīciṃ, tesaṃ lābhā”ti cābravi.","thag7.4:6.1":"“Ajjatagge maṃ sopāka, dassanāyopasaṅkama;","thag7.4:6.3":"Esā ceva te sopāka, bhavatu upasampadā”.","thag7.4:7.1":"“Jātiyā sattavassohaṃ, laddhāna upasampadaṃ;","thag7.4:7.3":"Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ, aho dhammasudhammatā”ti.","thag7.4:7.5":"… Sopāko thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
